        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "effectiveDateTime": "2025-11-22",
        "valueString": "No gross deformity; slight reduction in supraspinatus bulk compared with the left. Anterolateral shoulder tender just distal to the acromion; ACJ non-tender. Passive range of motion near full but painful from 80–120 degrees of abduction and forward flexion. Active abduction limited to approximately 90 degrees due to pain with possible weakness; painful arc present. Jobe test painful with mild weakness; external rotation against resistance painful with slight weakness; internal rotation (lift-off) near normal but uncomfortable."
      }
